WEBVTT

00:00:57.954 --> 00:01:00.579
a kid in the wrong place
at the wrong time.

00:01:00.912 --> 00:01:02.871
Lost to the streets, lost to the system

00:01:02.871 --> 00:01:04.663
or lost to gun violence.

00:01:04.704 --> 00:01:07.663
Or a kid that could be arrested
for a dirt bike.

00:01:07.704 --> 00:01:08.913
Because in my city

00:01:08.913 --> 00:01:11.704
it can be a misdemeanor
for possession of a dirt bike.

00:01:11.746 --> 00:01:14.788
This can be a likely story
for Black kids across the country.

00:01:14.829 --> 00:01:18.663
In cities like Miami,
Cleveland, Atlanta, Philly,

00:01:18.704 --> 00:01:21.246
whatever place had
the dirt bike task force.

00:01:21.579 --> 00:01:25.704
Now ask yourself if the thing
you use to relieve your stress,

00:01:25.746 --> 00:01:27.204
if it was demonized,

00:01:27.246 --> 00:01:28.496
would you still do it?

00:01:28.913 --> 00:01:30.579
If it was criminalized?